WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.926
An AI suggests one more alternative

00:00:28.926 --> 00:00:59.929
AND: a record must satisfy both

00:00:59.929 --> 00:01:27.814
OR: alternatives, including both

00:01:27.814 --> 00:01:52.619
NOT: remove the excluded set

00:01:52.619 --> 00:02:25.563
A weak alternative changes admission

00:02:25.563 --> 00:02:52.455
A compulsory term can close the gate

00:02:52.455 --> 00:03:27.233
Admission and order are separate decisions
